exceptis capitulis, sine ulla ordinis vel
 <COL N="LXVIIIA"></COL> formae immutatione in suam collectionem recepit.
Romanas vero leges ex una Collectione tripartita
transtulit <NOTE N="(273)" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="LXVIIIB" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="LXVIIIB"></COL> Ivo Pan. p. IV, c. 127-130; Coll. trip. p. III,
 <COL N="LXVIIIC"></COL> t. X, c. 6, 7, 8, 9.—Ivo Pan. p. V, c. 14-22; Coll.
trip. p. III, t. XXIX, c. 171, 239, 131, 113, 99, 132,
