202, 223, 224, 231, 270, 274; Coll. trip. p. III,
t. XXV, c. V.—Ivo Pan. p. VI, c. 1, 7, 11-13,
46, 48, 70-73, 110, 113; Coll. trip. p. III, t. III,
c. 1, 36, 20, 29, 115; t. XXIX, c. 95, 116; t. XV,
