56-58, 61, 64, 65, 109, 110, 112, 114, 120. C. 33,
Ps I, p. III, c. 98. C. 34-37. B. lib. III, c. 160-163.
C. 38-40. Ps. I, p. III, c. 104-106. C. 41-46. B. lib.
