227. Adulterium perpetravit, 8, 261. Examen causae ejus,
8, 334. Waltrada illegitima illius uxor, 8, 334.</P> <CAPTION COM="1365"><HI REND="ITALIC">Lotio.</HI></CAPTION> <P COM="1365">Pedes lavantur recens baptizatis, 1, 195. Hospitibus
